<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0f" />
		<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Privacy Policy - Photo AI</title>
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="page-content privacy-container">
			<header>
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="effective-date">Effective Date: March 1, 2026</p>
			</header>

			<main>
				<section>
					<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
					<p>
						AI Solutions UG (haftungsbeschränkt) ("we", "us", or "our") operates the Photo AI application (the "App") for Shopify merchants. 
						This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our App.
					</p>
					<p>
						By installing and using Photo AI, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
					
					<h3>2.1 Shopify Store Data</h3>
					<p>When you install Photo AI, we collect and process the following data from your Shopify store:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Store Information:</strong> Your shop domain, store name, and contact email</li>
						<li><strong>Product Data:</strong> Product names, descriptions, and images that you choose to enhance with our AI service</li>
						<li><strong>Authentication Data:</strong> OAuth tokens and session tokens required for secure API access</li>
						<li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your Shopify account ID and store owner details</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>2.2 Generated Content</h3>
					<p>We store and process:</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Source Images:</strong> Original product images you upload or select for AI processing</li>
						<li><strong>Generated Images:</strong> AI-enhanced images created by our service</li>
						<li><strong>Prompts and Instructions:</strong> Text prompts and editing instructions you provide</li>
						<li><strong>Image Metadata:</strong> Generation timestamp, processing duration, and technical parameters</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>2.3 Usage and Billing Data</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Subscription Information:</strong> Your current plan (Free, Basic, or Professional)</li>
						<li><strong>Usage Metrics:</strong> Number of images generated, billing period data, and overage usage</li>
						<li><strong>AI Call Logs:</strong> Requests sent to our AI engine, including prompts, token usage, and processing time</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>2.4 Technical Information</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Log Data:</strong> IP addresses, browser type, access times, and error logs</li>
						<li><strong>Performance Data:</strong> App performance metrics and usage patterns</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
					<p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>

					<h3>3.1 Service Delivery</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>To provide and maintain the Photo AI service</li>
						<li>To generate AI-powered product images based on your input</li>
						<li>To enable you to view, download, and manage generated images</li>
						<li>To sync generated images back to your Shopify product catalog</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>3.2 Billing and Account Management</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>To process subscription payments and manage billing periods</li>
						<li>To track usage against your plan limits and calculate overage charges</li>
						<li>To send billing notifications and receipts</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>3.3 Service Improvement</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>To analyze app performance and optimize AI processing</li>
						<li>To understand usage patterns and improve user experience</li>
						<li>To troubleshoot technical issues and provide customer support</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>3.4 Legal Compliance</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>To comply with legal obligations and respond to lawful requests</li>
						<li>To enforce our Terms of Service and protect our rights</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>4. Data Sharing and Third-Party Services</h2>

					<h3>4.1 Google Gemini AI</h3>
					<p>
						Photo AI uses Google's Gemini AI service to generate and enhance product images. 
						When you use our service, your product images and text prompts are sent to Google's AI infrastructure for processing. 
						Google's processing of this data is governed by their privacy policy and terms of service.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Data Minimization:</strong> We only send the minimum necessary data (images and prompts) to Google for processing.
					</p>

					<h3>4.2 Shopify</h3>
					<p>
						Our App operates within the Shopify ecosystem and uses Shopify's APIs to access your store data. 
						Shopify's handling of your store data is governed by their privacy policy.
					</p>

					<h3>4.3 Payment Processing</h3>
					<p>
						Subscription payments are processed through Shopify's billing system. 
						We do not directly collect or store your payment card information.
					</p>

					<h3>4.4 Hosting and Infrastructure</h3>
					<p>
						Our App is hosted on secure cloud infrastructure. Your data may be stored and processed on servers located in various regions 
						to ensure optimal performance and reliability.
					</p>

					<h3>4.5 No Sale of Data</h3>
					<p>
						<strong>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information or generated images to third parties for their marketing purposes.</strong>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>5. Data Storage and Security</h2>

					<h3>5.1 Data Storage</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Database:</strong> Store and account data is stored in a PostgreSQL database with encryption at rest</li>
						<li><strong>Image Storage:</strong> Generated images are stored securely and are accessible only to your store</li>
						<li><strong>Backup:</strong> Regular backups are performed to prevent data loss</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>5.2 Security Measures</h3>
					<p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Encrypted data transmission (HTTPS/TLS)</li>
						<li>Secure OAuth authentication with Shopify</li>
						<li>Access controls and authentication requirements</li>
						<li>Regular security audits and updates</li>
						<li>Secure handling of API tokens and session data</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>5.3 Data Retention</h3>
					<p>
						We retain your data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you with services. 
						When you uninstall the App, your data will be retained for a reasonable period (typically 90 days) 
						to allow for potential reinstallation, after which it will be permanently deleted.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>6. Your Data Rights (GDPR & Privacy Laws)</h2>
					<p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:</p>

					<h3>6.1 Access and Portability</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you</li>
						<li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Request your data in a machine-readable format</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>6.2 Correction and Deletion</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
						<li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data (subject to legal retention requirements)</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>6.3 Control and Restriction</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> Object to processing of your personal data in certain circumstances</li>
						<li><strong>Right to Restriction:</strong> Request restriction of processing in certain situations</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>6.4 Exercising Your Rights</h3>
					<p>
						To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@ai-solutions.dev">privacy@ai-solutions.dev</a>. 
						We will respond to your request within 30 days.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>7. Data Processing Location</h2>
					<p>
						Your data may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your country of residence. 
						These countries may have data protection laws that are different from the laws of your country. 
						We ensure that adequate safeguards are in place to protect your data in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						Our App is intended for use by businesses and is not directed to individuals under the age of 18. 
						We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
					<p>
						We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy 
						on this page and updating the "Effective Date" at the top. Significant changes will be communicated via email or 
						a prominent notice within the App.
					</p>
					<p>
						You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes. 
						Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
					<p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:</p>
					
					<div class="contact-info">
						<p><strong>AI Solutions UG (haftungsbeschränkt)</strong></p>
						<p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@ai-solutions.dev">privacy@ai-solutions.dev</a></p>
						<p>Support: <a href="mailto:support@ai-solutions.dev">support@ai-solutions.dev</a></p>
					</div>

					<p class="dpo-info">
						For GDPR-related inquiries, please contact our Data Protection Officer at the email address above.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="consent-notice">
					<h2>11. Your Consent</h2>
					<p>
						By using Photo AI, you consent to this Privacy Policy and agree to its terms. 
						If you do not agree with this policy, please do not use our App.
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<p>Last updated: March 1, 2026</p>
			</footer>
		</div>
		<Footer client:load left={[{ href: '/photo.ai', label: 'Back to Photo AI' }]} />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.privacy-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 2rem;
		color: #f8fafc;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	header {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
	}

	.effective-date {
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	main {
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #e0e7ff;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	ul {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		margin-left: 1.5rem;
		color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	strong {
		color: #e0e7ff;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	a {
		color: #8b5cf6;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}

	a:hover {
		color: #a78bfa;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.contact-info {
		background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
		border-left: 3px solid #8b5cf6;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.contact-info p {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.dpo-info {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.consent-notice {
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.consent-notice h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		color: #60a5fa;
	}

	footer {
		border-top: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
		padding-top: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	footer p {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.privacy-container {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		h2 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}

		h3 {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
